---
description: Run the Allyproof WCAG 2.2 AA deterministic Check before and after editing frontend markup.
globs: "**/*.html, **/*.jsx, **/*.tsx, **/*.vue, **/*.svelte, **/*.astro, **/*.component.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

Before and after editing HTML, JSX/TSX, Vue, Svelte, Angular or Astro markup, run the deterministic Allyproof Check (`check` through the `allyproof` MCP server, or `npx allyproof check <file> --format json`):

- Treat only Proven rule Findings as facts, and call `explain_rule` before fixing a Finding so you fix the cause rather than silencing the rule.
- Apply deterministic `fix` edits when provided and re-run the Check after every edit to confirm the Finding is gone and no new Finding was added.
- Never add an `allyproof-ignore` comment unless explicitly asked.
- Report Needs Review entries as needing human or browser verification, never as fixed or passing.
